  <li id="thy-r3"><span class="rf-for">表皮の深さ・実効厚さ・交流抵抗</span><span class="rf-src">C. P. Yue, S. S. Wong, “Physical Modeling of Spiral Inductors on Silicon,” <i>IEEE Trans. Electron Devices</i>, vol. 47, no. 3, pp. 560–568, 2000. 式 (6)・(13)・(14)</span></li>
  <li id="thy-r4"><span class="rf-for">Q・共振・帯域幅</span><span class="rf-src">D. M. Pozar, <i>Microwave Engineering</i>, 4th ed., Wiley, 2012. 6.1 節 直列・並列共振回路</span></li>
  <li id="thy-r5"><span class="rf-for" set:html={RF_GROVER} /><span class="rf-src">F. W. Grover, <i>Inductance Calculations</i>, Dover, 2004（初版 1946）</span></li>
  <li id="thy-r6"><span class="rf-for">2 層を直列につないだときの層の間の等価容量</span><span class="rf-src">A. Zolfaghari, A. Chan, B. Razavi, “Stacked Inductors and Transformers in CMOS Technology,” <i>IEEE J. Solid-State Circuits</i>, vol. 36, no. 4, pp. 620–628, 2001</span></li>
  <li id="thy-r7"><span class="rf-for">磁気双極子の軸上の磁界</span><span class="rf-src">J. D. Jackson, <i>Classical Electrodynamics</i>, 3rd ed., Wiley, 1999. 5.6 節</span></li>
